            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.25.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 25:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.1.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 1:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze mu kwezi kwa gatanu, ku musi wakwo ugira icumi, mur’ uwo mwaka ugira icumi n’icenda umwami Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babuloni ari ku ngoma, Nebuzaradani umukuru w’abashibamyi, yahora ahagarara imbere y’umwami w’i Babuloni, yinjira i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Araheza yanda umuriro ingoro y’Uhoraho n’ingoro y’ umwami, n’amazu yose y’i Yerusalemu, mber’ amazu yose y’ abahambaye ayatongoza umuriro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ingabo zose z’Abakaludaya zari kumwe n’uwo mukuru w’abashibamyi, zisangangura inzitiro zose z’i Yerusalemu impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.37.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 37:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Nebuzaradani, uwo mukuru w’abashibamyi, ajana bamwe bo muri ba nyarucari ar’ inyagano, bo n’amasigarira y’ abantu bāri bagisigaye mur’ ico gisagara, n’abāri baragiye kwisaba umwami w’i Babuloni, n’amasigarira y’abafundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Nebuzaradani, uwo mukuru w’abashibamyi, asiga abandi bo muri ba nyarucari bo mur’ ico gihugu ngo batunganye imizabibu, barime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.1+2CH.4.2+2CH.4.3+2CH.4.4+2CH.4.5+2CH.4.6+2CH.4.7+2CH.4.8+2CH.4.9+2CH.4.10+2CH.4.11+2CH.4.12+2CH.4.13+2CH.4.14+2CH.4.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 4:1-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.27.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 27:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.27.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ inkingi z’imiringa zari mu ngoro y’Uhoraho, n’ibitereko, na ca gikarabiro citwa ikiyaga cācuzwe mu miringa cāri mu ngoro y’Uhoraho, Abakaludaya barabijanjagura, bajana bino bimeneke vyose vy’imiringa i Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bajana n’imibindi, n’ ivyuma biyōra umunyota, n’imakasi, n’inzavya, n’udukombe, n’ ibintu vyacuzwe mu miringa vyose bākoresha mu vyo guhēreza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi n’ibikombe, n’ivyotero, n’inzavya, n’imibindi, n’ibiterekwakw amatara, n’udukombe, n’ ubgavya, uwo mukuru w’abashibamyi arabijana, ivyacuzwe mw izahabu ukwavyo, n’ivyacuzwe mw ifeza ukwavyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku vya za nkingi zompi, na ca kiyaga, na vya bishushanyo vy’amapfizi cumi n’ abiri bicuzwe mu miringa vyari biteretsweko ca kiyaga, na vya bitereko, ivyo umwami Salomo yari yaracurishirije ingoro y’Uhoraho: imiringa ivyo bintu vyose vyacuzwemwo ntiyagira akagero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku vy’inkingi, inkingi imweimwe uburebure bgayo bgar’ amatambge cumi n’umunani y’ ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora; ubunini bgo mu nda yayo bgagerwa n’umugozi w’amatambge cumi n’abiri; intimba yayo yagerwa n’intoke zine: imbere yar’ umuheha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yarik’ umwashi w’umuringa; uburebure bg’umwashi umwe‐umwe bgar’ amatambge atanu, kandi ku mwashi hārikw ibimeze nk’urusenga n’ibimeze nk’ amakomamanga impande zose, vyose vyācuzwe mu miringa: kandi n’inkingi ya kabiri yarikw ibisa n’ivyo, bo n’amakomamanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibisa n’amakomamanga vyari mirongwicenda na bitandatu ku mpande zine; amakomamanga yose na yose yar’ ijana kur’ urwo rusenga hirya no hino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
